{
    "title": "Lense: Disposable Event Camera",
    "description": "Lense is a digital disposable camera app for capturing unforgettable moments at weddings, parties, vacations, and more. With Lense, you can create stunning visual memories and effortlessly share them with friends and family. Discover Lense's unique features and enjoy the simplicity and charm of analog photography combined with the convenience of the digital world.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udcf8 Allow guests to capture precious moments with just one click. \r\nLense allows your guests to capture all the valuable moments, from romantic wedding vows to festive dance moves and breathtaking vacation views. You can determine how many photos each guest may take, just like a disposable camera!\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udd04 Effortlessly share your photos with a unique QR code. \r\nLense generates a unique QR code with a single tap that you can share with your guests. By scanning the code, they gain instant access to the disposable camera, allowing them to capture, view and download all the beautiful moments. The guests don\u2019t need to download any app to take pictures!\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udd54 Experience the thrill of anticipation with Lense's delayed photo revealing feature. \r\nCustomize the delay to your preference, whether it's a few hours, days, or even weeks. Build up the excitement among your guests as they eagerly await the unveiling of the captured memories.\r\n\r\n\ud83e\ude84 Embrace vintage nostalgia with Lense's disposable camera effect.\r\nGive your images a touch of vintage, play with colors, or use artistic overlays to add a unique and personal touch.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udd12 Securely store and relive your cherished memories with Lense.\r\nOur photo storage feature stores your photos for a year. As the organizer, you\u2019ll receive a download link to download all photos taken on your event.",
    "descriptionHTML": "Lense is a digital disposable camera app for capturing unforgettable moments at weddings, parties, vacations, and more. With Lense, you can create stunning visual memories and effortlessly share them with friends and family. Discover Lense&#39;s unique features and enjoy the simplicity and charm of analog photography combined with the convenience of the digital world.<br><br>\ud83d\udcf8 Allow guests to capture precious moments with just one click. <br>Lense allows your guests to capture all the valuable moments, from romantic wedding vows to festive dance moves and breathtaking vacation views. You can determine how many photos each guest may take, just like a disposable camera!<br><br>\ud83d\udd04 Effortlessly share your photos with a unique QR code. <br>Lense generates a unique QR code with a single tap that you can share with your guests. By scanning the code, they gain instant access to the disposable camera, allowing them to capture, view and download all the beautiful moments. The guests don\u2019t need to download any app to take pictures!<br><br>\ud83d\udd54 Experience the thrill of anticipation with Lense&#39;s delayed photo revealing feature. <br>Customize the delay to your preference, whether it&#39;s a few hours, days, or even weeks. Build up the excitement among your guests as they eagerly await the unveiling of the captured memories.<br><br>\ud83e\ude84 Embrace vintage nostalgia with Lense&#39;s disposable camera effect.<br>Give your images a touch of vintage, play with colors, or use artistic overlays to add a unique and personal touch.<br><br>\ud83d\udd12 Securely store and relive your cherished memories with Lense.<br>Our photo storage feature stores your photos for a year. As the organizer, you\u2019ll receive a download link to download all photos taken on your event.",
